---
description: Markdown and plan docs
globs: docs/**,**/*.md
alwaysApply: false
---
No emoji, no em dashes, no en dashes in tracked markdown.
`docs/plans/README.md` is the repo map until `docs/REPO_MAP.md` is generated (phase 11).
`docs/CONFIG.md` and `docs/features/**` are generated later; do not hand-edit stubs.
Folder `README.md` files stay under about 60 lines when you add them.
ADRs live in `docs/adr/` with the next free number and index entry.
Link ADR numbers in commit trailers for PROTECTED path work.
Plans in `docs/plans/` are spec; code wins when they disagree.